    "Scan your whole library": "扫描整个照片库",
    "One scan measures every photo and video on your device and tells you how many gigabytes you can reclaim — before you delete anything.": "一次扫描会测量设备上的每张照片和每段视频，在你删除任何内容之前，先告诉你能收回多少 GB。",
    "Duplicates, grouped and pre-picked": "重复项已分组并预选",
    "Every group shows how many copies it holds and what they weigh, with a “Best” badge on the one worth keeping. Select them all in a tap.": "每组都会显示包含多少份副本、共占多少空间，值得保留的那张带有“最佳”标记。一键即可全选。",
    "Review by swiping": "滑动逐张查看",
    "Swipe mode shows one photo at a time: right to keep, left to delete. Everything you remove lands in a trash bin first.": "滑动模式一次显示一张照片：右滑保留，左滑删除。移除的内容都会先进入回收站。",
    "Compress video without losing it": "压缩视频，但不丢失视频",
    "We show what each clip will save before you compress it — often tens of megabytes per video, same footage.": "压缩前就告诉你每段视频能省多少——画面不变，往往每段能省下几十 MB。",
    "Hide what’s private": "把私密内容藏起来",
    "The Secret Vault moves photos out of the Photos app and locks them behind a passcode or Face ID, encrypted on your device alone.": "私密保险箱会把照片移出“照片”App，用密码或面容 ID 锁定，并加密保存在你自己的设备上。",
    "Clean your memories as you browse": "边回顾边整理回忆",
    "“On This Day” brings back photos from past years — and tells you how many look-alikes in them you can clear on the spot.": "“那年今日”会带回往年的照片，并告诉你其中有多少相似照片可以当场清理。",
    "Review fast — swipe to keep or delete, with an undo bin.": "快速查看——滑动即可保留或删除，还有回收站可撤销。",
