    "Yes — 7 days free on the weekly plan. Apple grants the trial once per account, so if you have already used it on CleanSpace it won’t be offered again. It then becomes $6.99 / week unless you cancel at least 24 hours before it ends.": "有 — 周付方案可免费试用 7 天。Apple 对每个帐号只提供一次试用，因此若你已在 CleanSpace 用过，就不会再次出现。之后按每周 6.99 美元计费，除非你在结束前至少 24 小时取消。",
